hunderbowl LanesAMF Thunderbowl Lanes is now open in Quick Play and on the Tour.New Basic Shot TutorialNew to bowling games? The Basic Shot tutorial runs right after you create your bowler, and you can replay it any time from the Tutorials button, which is back on the ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T21:40:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038050","verified_at":"2026-10-24T00:18:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4522670-1847286114037341","game_id":"steam-4522670","kind":"announcement","title":"Get Your Custom Bowler Added to PBA Pro Bowling 2027!","summary":"Want to see your character in the game? Now is your chance!Whoever finishes Next Fest at the top of the ranked ten pin leaderboard gets their custom bowler added to PBA Pro Bowling 2027 as an opponent! That’s right: your bowler, your style, in the game for everyone to face when it launches December 17th.Imagine players around the world stepping up to the lane... and losing to you. Here’s how to claim your spot in the game:Download the demo while it’s still hereBuild your bowler and make them you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:28:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037341","verified_at":"2026-10-23T18:36:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4522670-1846651706691806","game_id":"steam-4522670","kind":"announcement","title":"The PBA Pro Bowling 2027 Demo is Live for a Limited Time!","summary":"It’s finally here, but not for long! The PBA Pro Bowling 2027 demo is out now on Steam through October 27th. Lace up, hit the lanes, and get your first look at the next generation of PBA Pro Bowling before launch day. Unlock an Exclusive ShirtPlay the demo to unlock an exclusive shirt that carries over to the full game, proof you were here before day one. Rep Storm Nation for a Chance to Win Show us how you rep Storm Nation! Grab a screenshot or clip of yourself using Storm gear or bowling as yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:30:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4522670-1845383656394738","game_id":"steam-4522670","kind":"announcement","title":"Join our live Q&A for a chance to win Alpha access!","summary":"Join our Q&A this Wednesday!This Wednesday, October 7th, from 5:00 - 6:00 pm CT, we’ll be hosting a live Q&A with our Game Lead, Hale Obernolte, in our Discord! This is a great time to ask any questions you have about the game, learn more about what changes we’re making, and get to know the team behind the game.Join the Discord and sign up for the Q&A here: https://discord.gg/tjftrBw8uCWin Alpha access!Haven’t gotten into the PBA Pro Bowling 2027 Alpha yet? Now is your chance! We’ll be giving aw","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T22:05:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394738","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4522670-1842846814454110","game_id":"steam-4522670","kind":"announcement","title":"First look at PBA Pro Bowling 2027 + Alpha Access!","summary":"We’re going live!Join us on Twitch to watch our Game Director, Hale Obernolte, play PBA Pro Bowling 2027, answer your questions, and pick 10 lucky winners to be added to Alpha testing for the game! He’ll be streaming today, September 7th, from 5:00 - 6:00pm CT on Twitch. Check it out through the link below!","occurred_at